</header>

<main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

    <!-- Left Column: Article Content & Verification -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white p-5 md:p-10 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 border-l-4 border-l-blue-500 overflow-hidden">

        <!-- Article Header -->
        <header class="mb-6">
            <div class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Verification Step <%= step %> of <%= totalSteps %></div>
            <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">Best Personal Finance Advice to Start in 2026</h1>
            <div class="flex items-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
                <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">By Starindia</span>
                <span class="mx-2">•</span>
                <span>February 18, 2026</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Top Ad Slot -->
        <div class="ad-slot ad-responsive">
            [ AdSense Responsive Ad Slot ]
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 1: VERIFICATION TIMER BOX (Mobile Optimized) -->
        <div class="verify-box flex flex-col items-center justify-center my-8" id="step1-box">
            <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2 text-center">Please Wait for Verification...</h3>
            
            <!-- Timer ID required by timer-script (Fixed height stops bouncing) -->
            <div class="text-5xl font-black text-red-500 my-2 h-16 flex items-center justify-center" id="timerDisplay">10</div>
            
            <!-- Instruction Text ID required by timer-script (Fixed height) -->
            <p id="instructionText" class="text-sm md:text-base font-bold text-gray-500 mb-6 animate-pulse h-6 text-center">Analyzing traffic quality...</p>

            <!-- Custom Scroll Button -->
            <button id="scroll-btn" class="hidden w-full max-w-sm mx-auto bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-4 px-4 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all items-center justify-center text-sm md:text-base" onclick="scrollToBottom()">
                Scroll Down & Click Continue <i class="fas fa-arrow-down ml-2"></i>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Article Body -->
        <div class="article-body mt-8 text-gray-700">
            <p>Best Personal Finance advice Money management in 2026 is more important than ever before. As the costs of living increase, digital financial services, the shift in labor markets, and simple access to credit, novices can easily have a panic attack when working to establish financial security. Personal finance advice is not just about being wealthy, but rather it is about being in charge of your money and making smart choices and building a safe future.</p>

            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-8d04cb21cd6c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Best Personal Finance Advice" class="article-image">
            
            <div class="ad-slot ad-banner">
                [ AdSense Inline Article Ad Slot ]
            </div>

            <p>All it takes is a person to acquire simple personal finance advice and knowledge and implement it with a uniform approach to create a sound financial base. This is a guide to the personal finance advice and tips that are practical and beginner-friendly. It concerned the mindset, habits, planning, and long-term growth.</p>

            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Developing a powerful budgeting routine</h2>
            <p>Personal finance advice is based on budgeting. Budgeting is not a constraint of your life; it only makes your money more organized so that you can use it in a better way. The novices ought to be directed to develop a basic and realistic budget that addresses the necessities such as rent, food, transport, and utilities as well as to make space to save and to enjoy themselves. Failure to budget in many people occurs in the year 2026 since they attempt to make it too strict.</p>

            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Saving Money as a Daily Habit</h2>
            <p>It is not about waiting till you have more cash to save, saving is a priority. Novices have the notion that to save they have to earn a very good salary, yet little and regular savings can do wonders in the long term. Saving is becoming easier than ever with the help of automatic savings devices and digital wallets in 2026. Savings should not be a choice, it must be a fixed cost. Discipline gets developed, and financial security is created even by small daily or weekly savings.</p>

            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579621970588-a35d0e7ab9b6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Smart Spending Behavior" class="article-image">
            
            <div class="ad-slot ad-responsive">
                [ AdSense In-feed Ad Slot ]
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Managing Debt Responsibly</h2>
            <p>One of the greatest financial problems of beginners is debt. In 2026, loans, credit cards and online credit services are readily available, and one can easily fall into the trap of debt. Not all debt is bad, but unmanaged debt is dangerous. Good debt management implies that one should know the interest rate, payment terms, and whether or not he or she can pay. Novices need not do unnecessary borrowing but pay off high interest liabilities before considering other debts. Debt management safeguards your future earnings and keeps your financial life under control.</p>

            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Creating Multiple Revenue Sources</h2>
            <p>The dependence on one source of income is risky in 2026. The world is experiencing a transformation in job markets, automation is on the rise, and economic uncertainty is usual. Novices will have to think of establishing more than one source of income at a young age. This does not imply working 24/7 but trying out side skills, working as a freelancer, online work, or starting a small business. Additional income provides economic stability, assists in quicker savings, and decreases the stress level.</p>

            <div class="ad-slot ad-banner">
                [ AdSense Inline Article Ad Slot 2 ]
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Learning the Fundamentals of Investing</h2>
            <p>It is not necessarily the prerogative of experts to invest. The novices can access easy online investment solutions and financial literacy in 2026. It is necessary to get to know simple terms of investment such as risk, returns, diversification and compounding. By investing, you will have your money working as opposed to being inactive. Novices are advised to learn first and then invest and begin with low-risk and long-run plans. Early investment will provide time with the ability to accumulate wealth over a safe period.</p>

            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616514197671-15d99ce7a6f8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Healthy Money Mindset" class="article-image">
            
            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Protect Your Financial Future</h2>
            <p>Personal finance advice comprises a component of financial protection that is frequently overlooked. These are insurance, safe digital procedures, and emergency financial planning. Online fraud, identity theft, and fraud are on the rise in 2026. Novices need to know how to secure their financial resources and products. Protection does not entirely relate to monetary matters but to a sense of safety and security in the long term.</p>

            <div class="ad-slot ad-responsive">
                [ AdSense In-feed Ad Slot ]
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold">Conclusion</h2>
            <p>Personal finance advice for a start-up in 2026 is more about simplicity, discipline and smart habits. It does not require elaborate ideas or affluence to accomplish. You must have attitude, organization, discipline, and awareness. With proper budgeting, saving, spending, debt management, income building, long-term planning and protection of your finances, you make a solid base to have financial freedom.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 2: FINAL CONTINUE BUTTON (Targeted by timer-script, Mobile Optimized) -->
        <div class="mt-12 text-center pb-8 border-b border-gray-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center" id="bottom-verify-section">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Verification Complete!</h3>
            
            <!-- Fixed height to prevent layout shifting -->
            <div id="bottom-waiting-text" class="text-gray-400 font-semibold italic mb-4 h-6 flex items-center justify-center">
                Please wait for the timer above to complete...
            </div>

            <!-- Continue Button ID required by timer-script -->
            <a id="continueBtn" href="#" class="hidden w-full max-w-sm mx-auto bg-blue-600 text-white py-4 px-4 rounded-full font-black text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition shadow-xl items-center justify-center">
                Continue to Next Step <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-2"></i>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Ad Slot -->
        <div class="ad-slot ad-responsive">
            [ AdSense Bottom Ad Slot ]
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Sidebar (Perfect for Sticky Ads) -->
    <aside class="lg:col-span-1 hidden lg:block">
        <div class="sticky top-6">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-6">
